:Create new customer;
:check for product availability.;
:v4: Are products available ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = "No"])
:Produce missing goods and send declining message;
:End process due to no products and decline message;
else ([v4 = "Yes"])
:continue with the process and send an order confirmation.;
split
:Inform stock department;
:Packing goods;
split again
:Inform accounting department;
:Write invoice;
end split
:Goods ready for delivery and invoice sent;
:Close order;
